:::card title="Marro's Map — scratched on birch bark"
<style>
.mapwrap{background:#2b241c;border:2px solid #4a3a26;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;max-width:340px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#c9b78e;position:relative;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.mapwrap .title{font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a774f;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px}
.alley{border-left:4px dashed #6e5a3a;border-bottom:4px dashed #6e5a3a;padding:10px 12px;position:relative}
.alley span{font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:.08em}
.dot{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#7a2c22;border:2px solid #d8c9a3;margin-left:10px;box-shadow:0 0 6px #7a2c22}
.note{margin-top:10px;font-size:.8rem;font-style:italic;color:#9c8a63}
.wet{position:absolute;top:6px;right:10px;width:18px;height:18px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#5a7891 0%,transparent 70%);opacity:.6;border-radius:50%}
</style>
<div class="mapwrap"><div class="wet"></div><div class="title">Rat Alley</div><div class="alley"><span>behind the chandlery</span><span class="dot" title="Gessa"></span></div><div class="note">"She hits hard. One eye. Don't blink."</div></div>
:::

The rain loosens in your hair as you slip down the lane behind the chandlery — oil lamps swaying in their glass cages, the whole street slick with spilled kerosene. A half-eaten pie sits on an upturned crate, and the crate sits next to a door propped open with a bottle.

You hear breathing before you see her: a one-eyed woman hunched over the pie, ledger tucked under her arm like a sleeping cat.
